---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Falck | Share Updates"
  description="Share progress with your team using clear, friendly updates in Falck."
  theme="light"
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 backdrop-grid opacity-60"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-20 left-[10%] h-[320px] w-[320px] rounded-full bg-emerald-300/40 blur-[140px] glow-pulse"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-[-25%] right-[8%] h-[420px] w-[420px] rounded-full bg-sky-300/40 blur-[160px] float-soft"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 reveal">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/70 px-4 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-600 border border-white/80">
          Share Updates
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Share real progress without the awkward handoff</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
          Falck packages your changes, writes a clear summary, and makes it easy to show your team what actually changed.
          No more screenshot decks. No more "trust me" updates. Your work reads like a crisp release note, not a bedtime
          story.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <Button href="/download">Download Falck</Button>
          <Button href="/features" variant="secondary">Back to the tour</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-center">
      <div class="space-y-4 reveal">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-emerald-500">Clear summaries</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Your team sees exactly what changed</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Falck turns your notes into a clean, readable update. The changes are real, and the summary reads like a human
          wrote it. Because it was a human. You. With help.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Share changes with one click
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Updates read like a calm recap
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Everyone stays aligned without extra meetings
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-window reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="app-window-bar">
          <span>Falck Desktop</span>
          <span>Share panel</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-400">
            <span>Share panel</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-500">Ready</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <div class="surface-muted px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Summary</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">"Updated onboarding copy and tightened CTA"</p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-muted px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Highlights</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">3 changes, 2 pages, ready for review</p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-dark px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Share now</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-emerald-100/70">Send to the team</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100/80 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-emerald-700">
            "I made a change" now comes with a diff. You're welcome.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-emerald-500">Narrative</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">A summary people read</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Falck turns your notes into a change story with context, not just code. It is a human-friendly explanation of the
          diff.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-500">Visibility</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Keep status visible</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Everyone can see what is shipping, what is ready, and what needs review. No hidden changes, no spooky surprises.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal-delay-2">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-500">Confidence</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Ship without drama</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Falck keeps the guardrails, so sharing is a confident step, not a negotiation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 pb-28">
    <div class="surface p-10 md:p-12 text-center reveal">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-400">Finish strong</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Ship the change, get the high-five</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Falck keeps the guardrails in place so you can share real progress with zero anxiety.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <Button href="/features/idea-studio">Idea Studio</Button>
        <Button href="/features/setup-concierge" variant="secondary">Setup Concierge</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
